[00:22.50]Every silence cuts too loud
[00:26.50]Lost but never backing down
[00:30.40]You say stay, I decay
[00:34.50]In the static we just fade
[00:38.40]Every heartbeat out of place
[00:42.50]Dancing on a blade
[00:44.50]
[00:45.60]Don’t save me now
[00:48.80]I like the fall
[00:52.50]No gravity when I lose it all
[00:58.00]
[00:59.40]Kill the glow, let it die
[01:03.40]Burn the stars out of my sky
[01:07.40]Feel the dark come alive
[01:11.40]I don’t need the light
[01:15.30]Cut the wires, lose control
